  "title": "National CineMedia Announces 2026 U.S. Young Lions Winners",
  "summary": "National CineMedia (NASDAQ: NCMI) (NCM), the largest cinema advertising platform in the US, and the U.S. Representative of the Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity, today announced the five winning teams of the 2026 U.S. Young Lions competition. The winning teams were named and honored by NCM on April 22, 2026, at the TEAM USA Winners Announcement event, with all finalist teams in attendance.",
